<title>JAPAN: Maruwn Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Maruwn Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.84		vs	   23.20</p>
<p> Operating	  197    million    vs	  152    million</p>
<p> Current	    205    million    vs	  223    million</p>
<p> Net		   67    million    vs	   46    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.44 yen	  vs	    1.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  27 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Maruwn Corp is a cargo transporter affiliated with Japan Energy Corp.</p>
